  "question": {
    "text": "If the domain of the function $f(x)=\\log _7\\left(1-\\log _4\\left(x^2-9 x+18\\right)\\right)$ is $(\\alpha, \\beta) \\cup(\\gamma, \\delta)$, then $\\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma+\\delta$ is equal to",
