  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Domain } 1-\\log _4\\left(x^2-9 x+18\\right) \\gt 0 \\\\ & \\text { Also } x^2-9 x+18 \\gt 0 \\\\ & (x-3)(x-6) \\gt 0\\end{aligned}$<br/>$x \\in(-\\infty, 3) \\cup(6, \\infty)$    ...(1)<br/>$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { also } x^2-9 x+18 \\lt 4 \\\\ & x^2-9 x+14 \\lt 0\\end{aligned}$<br/>$x \\in(2,7)$   ...(2)<br/>$\\begin{aligned} & (1) \\cap(2) \\quad(2,3) \\cup(6,7)=(\\alpha, \\beta) \\cup(\\gamma, \\delta) \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma+\\delta=18\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
